edia/commons/thumb/7/77/Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Nazi Germany" data-file-width="1000" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="14" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kurt_von_der_Chevallerie" title="Kurt von der Chevallerie">Kurt v.d. Chevallerie</a></li><li><b><u><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panzer_Group_West" title="Panzer Group West" class="mw-redirect">Panzer Group West</a></u></b>:</li><li><span class="nowrap"><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nazi_Germany" title="Nazi Germany"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Germany_(1935–1945).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Nazi Germany" data-file-width="1000" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="14" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leo_Geyr_von_Schweppenburg" title="Leo Geyr von Schweppenburg">Leo v. Schweppenburg</a></span></li><li><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nazi_Germany" title="Nazi Germany"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Germany_(1935–1945).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Germany_%281935%E2%80%931945%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Nazi Germany" data-file-width="1000" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="14" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heinrich_Eberbach" title="Heinrich Eberbach">Heinrich Eberbach</a></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th colspan="2" style="background-color:#C3D6EF;color:inherit;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;font-size:110%;">Strength</th></tr><tr><td style="width:50%;border-right:1px dotted #aaa;">
<span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409" about="#mwt49" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"}}'/></span><div class="plainlist ">
<ul><li>More than 1,452,000 troops by 25 July<sup about="#mwt52" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-12" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-12"}}'><a href="#cite_note-12" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwPg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwPw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQA">[</span>b<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li>2,052,299 (by the end of August)<sup about="#mwt55" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEBadsey199085_13-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEBadsey199085"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEBadsey199085-13"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEBadsey199085-13" id="mwQg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwQw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRA">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>

</div></td><td style="width:50%;padding-left:0.25em">
<span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409" about="#mwt57" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"}}'/></span><div class="plainlist ">
<ul><li>380,000 troops (by 23 July)<sup about="#mwt58" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEZetterling200032_14-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEZetterling200032"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEZetterling200032-14"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEZetterling200032-14" id="mwRg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwRw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSA">[</span>12<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li>~640,000 troops total<sup about="#mwt60" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEZetterling200034_15-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEZetterling200034"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEZetterling200034-15"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEZetterling200034-15" id="mwSg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwSw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTA">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li>2,200<sup about="#mwt62" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEShulman2007192_16-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEShulman2007192"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEShulman2007192-16"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEShulman2007192-16" id="mwTg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwTw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUA">[</span>14<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUQ">]</span></span></a></sup>–2,500 tanks and assault guns<sup about="#mwt64" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEWilmot1997434_17-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEWilmot1997434"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEWilmot1997434-17"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEWilmot1997434-17" id="mwUg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwUw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVA">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVQ">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt66" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEBuckley2006117–120_18-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEBuckley2006117–120"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEBuckley2006117–120-18"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEBuckley2006117–120-18" id="mwVg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwVw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwWA">[</span>16<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwWQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>

</div></td></tr><tr><th colspan="2" style="background-color:#C3D6EF;color:inherit;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;font-size:110%;">Casualties and losses</th></tr><tr><td style="width:50%;border-right:1px dotted #aaa;">
<span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409" about="#mwt68" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"}}'/></span><div class="plainlist ">
<ul><li><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States" title="United States"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_States_(1912-1959).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%281912-1959%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="United States" data-file-width="1235" data-file-height="650" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> 124,394 casualties; 20,668 killed<sup about="#mwt73" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-American_casualties_21-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"American casualties","group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-American_casualties-21"}}'><a href="#cite_note-American_casualties-21" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwWg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwWw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwXA">[</span>c<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwXQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Kingdom" title="United Kingdom"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_(1-2).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_Kingdom_%281-2%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="United Kingdom" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> ~65,000 casualties; 11,000 killed; 54,000 wounded or missing<sup about="#mwt77" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEbritannica.com_22-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEbritannica.com"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEbritannica.com-22"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEbritannica.com-22" id="mwXg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwXw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwYA">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwYQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada" title="Canada"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Canadian_Red_Ensign_(1921–1957).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Flag_of_Canada_%281921%E2%80%931957%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Canada_%281921%E2%80%931957%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Flag_of_Canada_%281921%E2%80%931957%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Canada_%281921%E2%80%931957%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Canada" data-file-width="1200" data-file-height="600" data-file-type="drawing" height="12" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> 18,444 casualties; 5,021 killed<sup about="#mwt79" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEStacey1960271_23-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEStacey1960271"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEStacey1960271-23"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEStacey1960271-23" id="mwYg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwYw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwZA">[</span>20<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwZQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poland" title="Poland"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Poland_(1928–1980).svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Flag_of_Poland_%281928%E2%80%931980%29.svg/40px-Flag_of_Poland_%281928%E2%80%931980%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Flag_of_Poland_%281928%E2%80%931980%29.svg/60px-Flag_of_Poland_%281928%E2%80%931980%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Poland" data-file-width="1280" data-file-height="800" data-file-type="drawing" height="14" width="23" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span> 2,097 casualties<sup about="#mwt81" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMaczek2006_24-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEMaczek2006"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEMaczek2006-24"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEMaczek2006-24" id="mwZg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwZw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwaA">[</span>21<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwaQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>

</div>

<p>16,714 Allied airmen killed (8,536 members of the USAAF, and 8,178 flying under the command of the RAF)</p>
<hr/>
<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409" about="#mwt83" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"}}'/><div class="plainlist ">
<ul><li>226,386 casualties in total<sup about="#mwt84" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003341_25-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003341"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003341-25"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003341-25" id="mwag"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwaw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwbA">[</span>22<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwbQ">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt88" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-26" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-26"}}'><a href="#cite_note-26" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwbg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwbw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwcA">[</span>d<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwcQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li>4,101 aircraft<sup about="#mwt91" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003341_25-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003341"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003341-25"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003341-25" id="mwcg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwcw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwdA">[</span>22<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwdQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li>~4,000 tanks<sup about="#mwt93" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003342_27-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003342"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003342-27"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003342-27" id="mwdg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwdw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mweA">[</span>23<span class="cite-bracket" id="mweQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>

</div></td><td style="width:50%;padding-left:0.25em">
<span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409" about="#mwt95" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"}}'/></span><div class="plainlist ">
<ul><li>~80,000 killed<sup about="#mwt96" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEInmanStaines2019La_Cambe_German_Military_Cemetery_28-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEInmanStaines2019La Cambe German Military Cemetery"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEInmanStaines2019La_Cambe_German_Military_Cemetery-28"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEInmanStaines2019La_Cambe_German_Military_Cemetery-28" id="mweg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwew"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwfA">[</span>24<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwfQ">]</span></span></a></sup><br/>233,000 captured<sup about="#mwt98" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-29" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-29"}}'><a href="#cite_note-29" id="mwfg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwfw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwgA">[</span>25<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwgQ">]</span></span></a></sup><br/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#Germany" class="mw-selflink-fragment">Casualties differ by source</a></li>
<li>2,127 aircraft<sup about="#mwt100" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003342–343_30-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003342–343"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003342–343-30"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTETamelanderZetterling2003342–343-30" id="mwgg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwgw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwhA">[</span>26<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwhQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li>1,500<sup about="#mwt102" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEZetterling200083_31-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEZetterling200083"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEZetterling200083-31"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEZetterling200083-31" id="mwhg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwhw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwiA">[</span>27<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwiQ">]</span></span></a></sup>–2,400 tanks and assault guns lost<sup about="#mwt104" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEWilmot1997434_17-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEWilmot1997434"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEWilmot1997434-17"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEWilmot1997434-17" id="mwig"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwiw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwjA">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwjQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul></div></td></tr>

<tr><td colspan="2" style="text-align:center;border-top:1px dotted #aaa;">
<p><b>Civilian deaths:</b></p>
<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409" about="#mwt106" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"}}'/><div class="plainlist ">
<ul><li>11,000–19,000 killed in pre-invasion bombing<sup about="#mwt107" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEBeevor2009519_32-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEBeevor2009519"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEBeevor2009519-32"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEBeevor2009519-32" id="mwjg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwjw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwkA">[</span>28<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwkQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li>13,632–19,890 killed during invasion<sup about="#mwt109" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEFlint2009336–337_33-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEFlint2009336–337"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEFlint2009336–337-33"}}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEFlint2009336–337-33" id="mwkg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwkw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwlA">[</span>29<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwlQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li><b>Total:</b> 25,000–39,000 killed</li></ul>

</div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="border-top:1px dotted #aaa;;text-align:center"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="navbox-styles"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1374427404" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt111" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Hlist/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist .mw-empty-li{display:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt::after{content:": "}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li::after{content:"\a0 · ";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li li:first-child::before{content:" (";font-weight:normal}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:last-child::a